  "note": "Tolerances are relative and are NOT uniform. PsychroLib implements the Chapter 1 equations, which omit the water-vapour enhancement factor; the published tables are computed from the real-gas formulation. Saturated humidity ratio and saturated enthalpy therefore disagree with the tables by up to 2% and 3% respectively. These are upstream-documented properties of the formulation, not defects, and the tolerances below are the ones PsychroLib itself asserts.",
